---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Metal Cube — 프로젝트 홈"
  description="Apple Silicon Mac 환경에서 순수 C++26과 metal-cpp로 구현한 9단계 의미론적 3D 회전 큐브 렌더링 프로젝트 홈"
>
  <div class="proj-hub">
    <nav class="proj-breadcrumb" aria-label="이동 경로">
      <a href="/learn/projects">Projects</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="current">Metal Cube</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="proj-hero">
      <div class="proj-hero-copy">
        <div class="proj-pills">
          <span class="proj-pill status">
            <span class="proj-dot"></span>
            COMPLETED · C++26 · metal-cpp
          </span>
          <span class="proj-pill meta">Apple Silicon · MSL · 9-Stage Pipeline</span>
        </div>

        <h1>Metal Cube (3D Rotating Cube)</h1>
        <p class="proj-desc">
          Objective-C 브릿지 없이 Apple 공식 <strong>metal-cpp</strong>와 <strong>모던 C++26</strong>만으로 구현한 하드웨어 가속 3D 회전 큐브 애플리케이션입니다.
          3D 가상 공간이 2D 물리 화면에 표출되기까지의 <strong>9단계 의미론적 렌더링 파이프라인</strong>을 헤더 모듈과 1:1로 대응시켜 설계했습니다.
        </p>

        <div class="proj-tags">
          <span>#Cpp26</span>
          <span>#MetalCpp</span>
          <span>#MSL</span>
          <span>#3DGraphics</span>
          <span>#AppleSilicon</span>
          <span>#RAII</span>
          <span>#TripleBuffering</span>
        </div>

        <div class="proj-actions">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/pargame/metal-cube"
            class="proj-btn primary"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
          >
            GitHub 리포지토리 ↗
          </a>
          <a href="/learn/projects" class="proj-btn ghost">
            ← 프로젝트 목록
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a
        href="/learn/projects/metal-cube/architecture"
        class="proj-thumb"
        aria-label="Metal Cube 아키텍처 문서 열기"
      >
        <div class="proj-thumb-art">
          <div class="cube-wireframe" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="cube-face front"></span>
            <span class="cube-face back"></span>
          </div>
          <span class="proj-thumb-label">C++26 × METAL-CPP</span>
        </div>
        <span class="proj-thumb-cap">9-Stage Semantic 3D Rendering Pipeline</span>
      </a>
    </header>

    <section class="posts-section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">DOCUMENTS IN THIS PROJECT</span>
        <h2>프로젝트 문서</h2>
        <p>의미론적 9단계 파이프라인과 C++26 모듈 구현 구조를 정리한 문서입니다.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="post-cards">
        <a href="/learn/projects/metal-cube/architecture" class="post-card">
          <div class="post-top">
            <span class="post-type">DOC 01 · 아키텍처</span>
            <span class="post-arrow">→</span>
          </div>
          <h3>9단계 의미론적 3D 렌더링 파이프라인 &amp; C++26 설계</h3>
          <p>
            Local → World → View → Clip → Screen 좌표계 전이 사슬, 9단계 렌더링 인과 모델과 1:1 매핑된 헤더 아키텍처, 그리고 <code>NS::SharedPtr</code> RAII 및 C++26 적용 포인트를 정리했습니다.
          </p>
          <div class="post-tags">
            <span>#아키텍처</span>
            <span>#9StagePipeline</span>
            <span>#metal-cpp</span>
            <span>#TripleBuffering</span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .proj-hub {
    --p-accent: #38bdf8;
    --p-accent-2: #818cf8;
    --p-border: color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 30%, var(--border));
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3rem;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .proj-hub {
    --p-accent: #0284c7;
    --p-accent-2: #4f46e5;
  }

  .proj-breadcrumb {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.84rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    margin-bottom: -1.6rem;
  }
  .proj-breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--text-2);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .proj-breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: var(--p-accent);
  }
  .proj-breadcrumb .current {
    color: var(--p-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .proj-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--p-border);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 16%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 14%, transparent), transparent 45%),
      var(--surface-1);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-1);
  }
  .proj-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .proj-pill {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 0.28rem 0.65rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }
  .proj-pill.status {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--success);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--success) 12%, transparent);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--success) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .proj-dot {
    width: 0.45rem;
    height: 0.45rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--success);
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--success);
  }
  .proj-pill.meta {
    color: var(--text-2);
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }
  .proj-hero-copy h1 {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 1.4rem + 1.4vw, 2.4rem);
  }
  .proj-desc {
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }
  .proj-desc strong {
    color: var(--text-1);
  }
  .proj-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  }
  .proj-tags span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    color: var(--p-accent);
  }
  .proj-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.7rem;
  }
  .proj-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.58rem 1.05rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .proj-btn.primary {
    background: var(--p-accent);
    color: #0b1120;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
  }
  :global([data-theme="light"]) .proj-btn.primary {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .proj-btn.primary:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.08);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .proj-btn.ghost {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .proj-btn.ghost:hover {
    border-color: var(--p-accent);
    color: var(--p-accent);
  }

  .proj-thumb {
    display: block;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform var(--dur), border-color var(--dur), box-shadow var(--dur);
  }
  .proj-thumb:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: var(--p-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px -10px color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .proj-thumb-art {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 25%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 22%, transparent), transparent 55%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 75% 75%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent-2) 22%, transparent), transparent 55%),
      var(--surface-2);
  }
  .cube-wireframe {
    position: relative;
    width: 72px;
    height: 72px;
  }
  .cube-face {
    position: absolute;
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 2px solid var(--p-accent);
  }
  .cube-face.front {
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 16%, transparent);
  }
  .cube-face.back {
    bottom: 0;
    right: 0;
    border-color: var(--p-accent-2);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent-2) 14%, transparent);
  }
  .proj-thumb-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--p-accent);
  }
  .proj-thumb-cap {
    display: block;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.85rem;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.73rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .section-head {
    margin-bottom: 1.3rem;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--p-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }
  .section-head h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    font-size: 1.45rem;
  }
  .section-head p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 0.94rem;
  }

  .post-cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.3rem;
  }
  .post-card {
    background: var(--surface-1);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--p-accent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 1.7rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    transition: all var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .post-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    border-color: var(--p-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px -12px color-mix(in srgb, var(--p-accent) 35%, transparent);
  }
  .post-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .post-type {
    color: var(--p-accent);
  }
  .post-arrow {
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    transition: transform var(--dur-fast), color var(--dur-fast);
  }
  .post-card:hover .post-arrow {
    color: var(--p-accent);
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }
  .post-card h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-1);
  }
  .post-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .post-tags {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    padding-top: 0.4rem;
  }
  .post-tags span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    background: var(--surface-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .proj-hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
